<title>USA: FSA qualifies Vadercook Lake SD, Mich.,.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies Vadercook Lake SD, Mich.,.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said on Monday it qualified for bond insurance Vandercook Lake School District, Mich., $5.495 million General Obligations, scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
